{"seq":28,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r1-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-rr-l2-mu-v04-dev/rr-07-l2-quarrendon-ticket-retired/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T16:08:53.596Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"a850ce1b874f6e9c9b2e79753f4340163a8d6eaa46239ca4fd00c74b9c1d6e4d","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","text":"Hi Ilse, here's what I found for Quarrendon Freight Lines:\n\n• Eau Claire gatehouse kiosk alerts: ticket #PD-4492. Thea Ramaswell logged it on 4 Oct 2025 because drivers on the 04:00 shift at Dock Doors 14–18 weren't getting their SMS bay assignments. Support patched it that evening, and Thea confirmed on 5 Oct that it was fixed. I got this from Moss's 5 Oct 2025 Sunday prep note in the knowledge base. I couldn't find that note in the file share, so it may be worth checking against the ticket system. Also, don't mix it up with #4419: the North cheat sheet lists that one for the Door 14 barcode scanners, and Marcus's notes list it for Gate 3 printer lag.\n• Amendment No. 1 seat count: 185. Dana first posted 180 in #north-team on 20 Aug 2025, then corrected it to 185 a few minutes later."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0002","ts":"1792245600.000127"}}
